flowchart LR
    T[THREAT<br/>External]:::red --> M{Crew Manages<br/>Threat?}
    M -- Yes --> S[Safe Flight]:::green
    M -- No --> E[ERROR]:::red
    E --> EM{Crew Manages<br/>Error?<br/>avoid/trap/mitigate}
    EM -- Yes --> S
    EM -- No --> UAS[UNDESIRED<br/>AIRCRAFT STATE]:::red
    UAS --> R{Recovery?}
    R -- Yes --> S
    R -- No --> ACC[Incident /<br/>Accident]:::red
    classDef red fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef green fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
